# doppler_project_member_service_account (Resource)

Manage a Doppler project service account member.

**Note:** The `doppler_project_member_service_account` resource will clear/replace all existing roles the member holds on the project.
Combinations of `doppler_project_member_service_account` and `doppler_project_member_service_account_role_assignment` for the same member will produce inconsistent behavior.
To give a member several roles, use `doppler_project_member_service_account_role_assignment` only.

